{
  "name": "nix-rust",
  "description": "nix-rust provides Rust-friendly bindings to various *nix platform APIs, including Linux, Darwin, and several BSD distributions. The project aims to unify common system interfaces where possible while still exposing platform-specific functionality through idiomatic Rust abstractions. It covers a broad spectrum of low-level systems programming tasks such as socket manipulation, signal handling, and terminal control.",
